MISSION=MISSION_LOOP_V1

OBJECTIVE
Create the Runtime autonomous execution loop.

LOOP
1. Select next eligible mission
2. Verify dependencies
3. Build execution plan
4. Execute mission
5. Compile
6. Run affected tests
7. Record evidence
8. Promote if successful
9. Continue until blocked or complete

STOP CONDITIONS
- Build failure
- Test failure
- Policy violation
- Human approval required

MUST NOT CHANGE
- RuntimeKernel
- MissionOrchestrator
- PatchEngine
- ExecutionPlanner

SUCCESS
- Runtime executes successive missions autonomously
- Every decision recorded in mission-ledger
- Loop stops only on proven blocker
